+  }
+
+  //================================================================================
+  /*!
+   * \brief Return the larger principal curvature magnitude at the parameters last set
+   *
+   * pySMESH: OCCT 8 returns the cached curvature of the previous parameters from
+   * MaxCurvature() and MinCurvature() unless IsCurvatureDefined() runs first:
+   * GeomLProp_SurfaceUtils::RequireCurvature() takes the cached value by value, before it
